{.lead} A short note on a repository change landing Friday, and the one minute it asks of you.

We are renaming the default branch from master to main across all repositories on Friday. The change is automated and should be invisible for everyday work.

---

## What changes
- New clones check out main by default.
- Open pull requests retarget automatically.
- Branch protection and CI move with the branch.

---

## What to do
For an existing local clone, run the three commands in the runbook. It takes under a minute.

:::callout note
If you reference the branch name in a script or a webhook, update it to main before Friday.
:::
